    LLM: 'Try to be either the highest scorer or the lowest scorer. Avoid the middle. Be careful not to reach 100 points which carries a heavy penalty.\n\nControl when trumps are established. Win early tricks to control play. In four players, coordination is harder but watch for opportunities to force others into the middle.\n\nTrack all cards to predict trump establishment. Calculate risk of reaching 100 points. Understand when to push for high score vs. when to dump points.',
